{
  "description": "The server's review of the desk's other documents (sync spec §6.2, W1-11): never a refusal (rule 7), only findings. `doc` picks a base document from cash-review in drawer.test.ts (R: D01-R000001 by the cashier …a5; M: D01-M000004 by …a5; open: D01-Z000006 by …a5 with a Rs 5,000 float; close: D01-Z000007 of …a5's session, closed by …a5, Rs 300 short, acknowledged by the manager …a2) and `changes` overrides its fields. Staff as in testing/desk.ts. cash_not_permitted: the server says someone lacked a permission (ownVariance when the acknowledger is the session's own cashier); float_mismatch: an open's float differs from what stayed at the desk's last close.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a collection by the cashier",
      "input": {
        "doc": "R"
      },
      "expected": []
    },
    {
      "name": "a collection by someone without cash.collection.receive",
      "input": {
        "doc": "R",
        "changes": {
          "cashierId": "019a0000-0000-7000-8000-0000000000a6"
        }
      },
      "expected": [
        {
          "kind": "cash_not_permitted",
          "userId": "019a0000-0000-7000-8000-0000000000a6",
          "permission": "cash.collection.receive",
          "ownVariance": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "a cash-out by the cashier",
      "input": {
        "doc": "M"
      },
      "expected": []
    },
    {
      "name": "a cash-out by someone the server doesn't know",
      "input": {
        "doc": "M",
        "changes": {
          "cashierId": "019a0000-0000-7000-8000-0000000000a9"
        }
      },
      "expected": [
        {
          "kind": "cash_not_permitted",
          "userId": "019a0000-0000-7000-8000-0000000000a9",
          "permission": "cash.movement.create",
          "ownVariance": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "an open with the float that stayed",
      "input": {
        "doc": "open"
      },
      "expected": []
